theorem `fg_iff` / 定理 `fg_iff`

English:
theorem fg_iff
  given: [Mul M] {I : SemigroupIdeal M}
  statement: I.FG ↔ exists (s : Finset M), I = closure s
  proof: SubMulAction.fg_iff

中文:
定理 fg_iff
